*.pyc
vendor/

# The Qwen artifacts ARE carried, so a clone runs with no setup. They
# are also pinned in data/qwen/MANIFEST.json and reproducible by
# tools/get_qwen.py from a local directory or a URL -- belt and
# braces, because a checked-in file can still be corrupted in transit
# and the manifest is what notices.
#
# route-events.jsonl is the ASSEMBLED 106.1 MiB file. Only its two
# parts are tracked, because GitHub refuses any single file over
# 100 MB. There is no cap on the repository as a whole.
data/qwen/route-events.jsonl
